# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites line
# endings on every file git touches and warns about it on each `git add`:
#   "LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it"
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never apply text/line-ending conversion.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db    binary
